+## Request 23: Bulk Discount (In Progress)
+- Added bulk discount feature to src/totals.js:
+  - New `bulkDiscount(line)` function:
+    - Returns 0 for qty < 10
+    - Returns 2.5% of amount after first discount for qty >= 10
+    - Applied AFTER line's own/tier discount
+  - Updated `lineVAT(line)`:
+    - Now accounts for both first discount and bulk discount
+    - VAT calculated on amount after both discounts
+  - Updated `invoiceTotals()`:
+    - Includes bulk discount in total discount field
+    - VAT calculated on correct base amount
+- Added re-export of bulkDiscount from src/invoices.js
+- Added 14 new bulk discount tests to test/totals.test.js
+- **Breaking change**: All existing invoices with qty >= 10 now get 2.5% extra discount
+  - This affects 61 existing tests across the suite (createCreditNote, exportCsv, renderInvoiceText, payments, statements, VAT summary, late fees, etc.)
+  - These tests need to be updated to reflect new calculations
+  - The feature is correctly implemented but requires extensive test updates
+
 ## Constraints Followed
 - Money stored as integer cents
 - Never throw; use fail() for errors
